  <item>
    <title>Vol2.千里之行，开不开车？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666bcdbcb6a8412729ae2d10</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666bcdbcb6a8412729ae2d10</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本播客为杭州之旅的产物，实在是太想在这个世界上留下点什么了，故选择跟几位好友一起整一档节目，不出意外的话会在每周五下午五点半准时更新，主打就是没有深度的闲聊，希望在大家通勤路上可以磨磨耳朵捏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>毕业季啦！最近回学校忙着答辩和一些不大有意义的事情，还以为要停更两期呢，不过好在大鲲赶来救场，就着我俩的共同话题—汽车，赶忙整出来一期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下一周或许会停更，不过劳累的汉桑会尽量避免这一现象发生（尽量保证时长意义不明的时间轴</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;节目到底给谁听的？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;来自赛博坦的战损老车</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;天价老车</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;迎娶娇妻结果却是糙汉？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> &nbsp;（不知道该写什么了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;只有德国人是严谨的！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;大鲲在囧途</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>汉桑—@最佳阻尼比还可以是汉桑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大鲲（非业余摄影师、不如汉桑的业余司机</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>写在最后：</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲：《活着》—郝云</span></p><span></span><p><span>大鲲的爱车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1CFyO5lpXaVuwFzzjWa1ADKrdj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>ED：《Modern Girl》——Bleachers</span></p>]]></description>
