    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本播客为杭州之旅的产物，实在是太想在这个世界上留下点什么了，故选择跟几位好友一起整一档节目，不出意外的话会在每周五下午五点半准时更新，主打就是没有深度的闲聊，希望在大家通勤路上可以磨磨耳朵捏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏天来咯，就能让人想到在海边喝啤酒，鲜花和橘子汽水。要是能和另一半在海边约会可就太浪漫了，所以说本期邀请来几位朋友一起来讲一讲经历过的最疯狂以及最浪漫的事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>意义不明的时间轴</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> &nbsp;汉桑故事会—1</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> &nbsp;汉桑故事会—2（为爱肉疼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">07:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;汉桑故事会—3（离家出走只为往南方开</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">09:08</a> &nbsp;肉泥泪洒迷笛</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;纯情汉桑鸭绿江边抹泪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;贾维斯的异地恋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;何不一路向西去大理？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;如何被触动？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4595">76:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;贾维斯的中年相亲烦恼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>汉桑—@最佳阻尼比还可以是汉桑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Jarvis—@Jarvis_PtdT</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>肉泥（本期发音惨遭雪藏）—@肉泥同学</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小鳄鱼—@-鳄鱼听了都要做噩梦-</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>爱问—@Evan攒钱买相机版</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>写在最后：</span></p><span></span><p><span>受客观因素的影响，这期节目的音质有一点下次，这个问题总归是会解决的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>汉桑推荐的歌曲：《他说他非常的爱你》—黑薄荷</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中肉泥提到的照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fth2XSMfHTbUbmtpqQpYj09NHl7c.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>ED：《霓虹甜心》——马赛克</span></p>]]></description>
